  * Exception: `data/geo/` holds third-party basemap extracts that carry their own
    licences and are NOT covered by the above.  The Natural Earth files are public
    domain; the OpenStreetMap extracts are Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0 and must
    be attributed to OpenStreetMap contributors.  ODbL data cannot be relicensed, so
    it is redistributed here under ODbL.  See data/geo/SOURCES.md for the per-file
    provenance and licence.

